title Fold AF -- a run's whole opening, and the two absentees that both came home
prompt Autonomous loop -- Kyri voice and Radiant Style first, then REMEMBER and the itineraries, Standfast on reds, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, one council-rota doc deep-read, send the increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. The living REDS ledger holds seven rows and every one of them reads CLOSED -- %81, %83's booked prevention landed, %84, %98, %110. No open agent-closable red stands, so the constructive queue is free to open.
think Council rota, lap index 594 kyri logs mod 27 -> item 27, recursion-prompts/README.md. Deep-read. Its balance compass names the seven styles held together and its four disciplines land straight on a fold: witness before narrative, one clock, accrete never break, and the gates as the fence. The line that governed this lap is its first -- a prompt rewards something, so keep the reward pointed at finished, proven, bounded work. A fold queue is exactly that reward made countable.
think The queue named start_one at 40 rungs by 35 lines, 1,365 carried -- the crux on carried lines, with return_promised_reach and carry_the_amendment tied at 1,353 behind it. Hashing every start_one body across the ladder found fifty-seven, and they sort into ten texts: the canonical forty, a nine-rung shallower shape at nineteen lines, and eight singletons.
think Two of those eight singletons stand at thirty-five lines, the canonical's own length, and both differ in exactly one line -- the reach that names the abandoning tally. The canonical writes abandoning_of(report_out).inner.inner; reckon.rye writes below_of(report_out).inner.inner and abandon.rye writes below_of(report_out).inner. Reading the accessors settles both.
think abandon.rye OWNS the abandoning tier, so its below_of returns the reclaim rung below and the body climbs back two hops -- which is exactly report_out.inner.inner. An identity accessor named abandoning_of gives the canonical text the same two hops from the same pointer. The tier owner comes home, the fifth to do so after relent.rye, repose.rye, and abide.rye.
think reckon.rye stands one rung ABOVE abandon.rye, so its below_of already returns the abandon rung's report -- the very type abandoning_of returns everywhere else. Three lines naming the neighbor by the shared word folds it too. This is a sixth reading the arc had not met: an absentee that is neither owner nor dated, merely a rung close enough to reach the tier by its position rather than by its name.
think The other six singletons stay home honestly. confer.rye and entrust.rye carry different reach semantics outright; revoke.rye and entrust.rye lack the generation block entirely, a shape born before it; reclaim.rye reaches one hop shallower with no accessor to bridge it. No accessor gives a body back a check it never had.
think Fold Z's rule read the reach closure next, and the neighborhood was nearly free. Of the twelve symbols start_one reaches through its rung, eleven already stood public in all forty-two. Only revoke_rung stood private, and widening that one word paid the whole fold.
think Four of the reached symbols are whole carrying families in their own right, each one text with a single shape: open_generation at forty-three rungs by ten lines, promise_pruning at forty-three by eleven, promise_falling at forty-two by eight, and offer at forty-five by seven. Together they are the four promises a run writes to the wire before it spawns anything, and lifting them beside the body that calls them keeps the sequence readable in one place.
think The fold line held once, as fold AB taught. offer stood in forty-five rungs, and one of them is confer.rye -- which ladder_checks.rye itself imports. Folding it would have a rung the harness reaches for reach back through the harness, so confer.rye stays home and offer folded at forty-four. revoke.rye stood below no such line and simply lacked the import; one line seated it.
obs The carry fell 103,057 -> 101,252, a fall of 1,805 against 3,017 lines of body removed and 411 inserted across 47 files. Ceiling 103,100 -> 101,300. Carrying families held at 707: every one of the five folded whole, so no visibility split opened and none healed.
obs The price of the whole lap was one widened word in forty-three modules and two three-line accessors. Fold Z's rule keeps paying -- a clean neighborhood is a signal that the folds before it already bought the visibility this one needed.
obs The lesson is that an absentee's distance from its cohort is a position on the ladder rather than a fact about its body. abandon.rye and reckon.rye wrote different lines for the same reason: each stood close enough to the abandoning tier to reach it without the long name. One owned the tier, one neighbored it, and both came home for three lines apiece.
