recommend keep-going the queue now names return_promised_reach at 42 rungs by 33 lines and carry_the_amendment at 34 by 41, both at 1,353 carried and tied for the crux -- take return_promised_reach first since its wider cohort spreads any widening cost further; hash the family before trusting the count, read the reach closure for whole families, and check every member against the harness import list, since offer proved this lap that the fold line still bites at forty-five
